{"id":"n55381-1-10","stage":1,"title":"머리카락 · 发丝","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55381-1-10-1","ko":"어머, 언니도 벌써 흰 머리카락이 있네?","zh":"哎呀，姐姐你也已经有白头发了呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"언니도","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니도","audio":"/audio/81959557eda797d07390.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"흰","meaning":"白","explanation":"희다：白；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"희다","audio":"/audio/f6fa3f151f72336ac101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92491","senseId":"1","lemma":"희다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흰","audio":"/audio/78c85a339611089cada2.mp3"}},{"text":"머리카락이","meaning":"发丝","explanation":"머리카락：发丝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리카락","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55381","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리카락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리카락이","audio":"/audio/cacfbe3db1a94bf2a5c4.mp3"}},{"text":"있네?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네","audio":"/audio/a43e47a1fb823079c63a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"f6fa3f151f72336a","term":"희다","zh":"白","audio":"/audio/f6fa3f151f72336ac101.mp3","entryId":"92491","definition":"像雪或牛奶的颜色一样亮而鲜明。","pronunciation":["히다"]},{"id":"7cffa7bdc9cb4857","term":"머리카락","zh":"发丝","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3","entryId":"55381","definition":"一根根头发。","pronunciation":["머리카락"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7989902f4fde0106bc6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55381-1-10-2","ko":"나도 벌써 마흔이 넘었잖아.","zh":"我早就超过四十岁了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"마흔이","meaning":"四十","explanation":"마흔：四十；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마흔","audio":"/audio/54eb25b7e0b7b69206c4.mp3"}],"sources":[